('61da59ec-4855-4e01-8303-31da07deda50', DATE '2026-06-16', 'list', '[CE-117] SIT - Environment setup Software Installation (SVFE, SVBO, SVCG)', 'Medium', '<div>+ Disable SMS Gate IP</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; - <font color="#f28e0f">Change IP to Dummy IP</font></div><div>+ SMS Gateway Using v1.1</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Pls use<font color="#f28e0f"><b> SMSGate v1.1</b></font>, v1.3 not work.</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Need to upgrade new config file.</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Version 1.1 is work with current config file.</div><div>+ Import Database from PROD</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Command to import Database</div><div>-----------------------------------</div><div>impdp SVCG@SISVDB schemas=SVCG directory=DMP_DIR dumpfile=svcg_SVCG_backup_2026-06-11_10-06_%U.dmp logfile=impSVCG_$(date +%F_%H-%M).log parallel=2</div>', DATE '2026-06-08', 'Completed', '1106997e-7ec9-44c4-bfed-15d6dab183bb'),
('6e63e3d0-d299-43b7-8cb7-e4321b6cdc35', DATE '2026-07-16', 'list', '[CE-128] PROD - Missing Credit Card Statement txt File for a Customer', 'Medium', '<div>+ Temporary Solution: Manual Run Container Export TXT again by select account number.</div><div>+ <font color="#f28e0f">Keep investigate for the root cause as no any data missing after we verify.</font></div><div>+&nbsp;You can compare total invoice id based on invoice_date and total statement records that has exported by the package <font color="#f28e0f"><b>CST_CAB_API_STATEMENT_PKG_prod</b></font>.zip .</div>', DATE '2026-07-15', 'In Progress', 'b4b761d5-96f7-4d7a-880d-62a018c21e6b'),
('65e3c859-9a89-4e1c-895b-8de512785008', NULL, 'list', '[CE-129] PROD - Account Credit Cash Limit Contain Invalid Amount', 'Medium', '+ Developer Checking.<div>+ Provide data to Bong Kimsour</div><div>+ Found Limit start wrong from <font color="#f28e0f"><b>15-May-2026</b></font></div><div>+ To testing with decimal value in env40</div>', DATE '2026-07-15', 'In Progress', 'b4b761d5-96f7-4d7a-880d-62a018c21e6b'),
