('bf483057-924d-4f9e-a040-8a3c1a5c27cd', NULL, 'list', U&'[CE-130] New Static Page Service \2013 Deployment for DN100 Machine', 'Medium', '1. To answer the question from bong Pitou regarding requirement for process ER document<div>2. <b><font color="#f28e0f">[20-Jul-2026]</font></b> Got the answer from ATM Vendor.</div><div>3. <b><font color="#f28e0f">[21-Jul-2026]</font></b> After meeting with ATM Vendor, there''s some conclusion</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Option1: FC to check with Humacx for Web UI Solution</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Option2: CUBC to check with parent bank for Web UI</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Option3: CUBC to check directly with Humacx</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Option4: Go with SmartVista</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ FC intent to design Web UI for CUBC with DN</div><div>4. <font color="#f28e0f"><b>[22-Jul-2026]</b></font> Quick call with bong Sopheap for discussion project scope</div><div>5. <b><font color="#f28e0f">[24-Jul-2026]</font></b> Vendor design static screen and test some trx working in ATM</div>', DATE '2026-07-17', 'In Progress', 'd1b6f9e2-4af2-4e98-bf7f-d554c22f4af0'),
('1541ef61-193a-4c7e-81cc-311b4fe01d8d', DATE '2026-07-28', 'list', '[CE-123] SIT - SIT Testing Issue on SIT Environment ', 'Medium', '<b>1. Nwint Service stopped after test Us-on-Them VISA</b><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Apply DB Script&nbsp;<font color="#f28e0f">svfe_db_patch_984.sql</font> <b>#34</b></div><div><b>&nbsp; &nbsp;</b>+ Apply DB Script&nbsp;<font color="#f28e0f">APA 5096_MC_26Q2_SVFE_DB_Changes.zip&nbsp;</font><span style="font-weight: bolder;">#40</span></div><div><b>&nbsp; &nbsp;</b>+ Retest, Issue was fixed. [<b><font color="#1fe01f">2026-07-16</font></b>]</div><div><br></div><div><b>2. SVWEB Issue, Error View Card Limit&nbsp;<font color="#e0271f">ORA-06550</font></b></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Verify Data Source connection</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Apply&nbsp;<font color="#f28e0f">svwi_scripts_09072026.zip</font> under SVISTA <b>#11</b></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Provide missing 3 script&nbsp;<font color="#f28e0f">svwi_scripts_10072026.zip</font> <b>#16</b></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Apply <font color="#f28e0f">V_WEB_ESCALATION.sql</font>&nbsp;under SVISTA <b>#20</b></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Apply&nbsp;<font color="#f28e0f">V_WEB_INVEST_ISS_latest.sql</font> under SVWEB <b>#21</b><br>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Apply&nbsp;<font color="#f28e0f">svfe_db_patch_257.sql</font> <b>#41</b></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Retest, Issue was resolved. [<b><font color="#1fe01f">2026-07-16</font></b>]</div><div><br></div><div><b>3. Unable to view Key Data in&nbsp;Issuer Security Schemes</b></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Apply update script&nbsp;</div><div><i><font color="#660ff2">UPDATE t_web_application_parameters SET param_type = ''BOOLEAN'' WHERE param_name = ''TRANSLOG_USER_RESTRICTION'';</font></i></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Apply DB Patch from&nbsp;<b>CE-93 #1 </b><font color="#f28e0f">FeDbPatches.zip</font></div><div><font color="#f28e0f">&nbsp; &nbsp;</font>+&nbsp;Checking table&nbsp;<font color="#f28e0f">t_iss_tran_scheme_exceptn_hist</font> &amp; <font color="#f28e0f">t_tran_param_set</font></div><div><font color="#f28e0f">&nbsp; &nbsp;</font>+&nbsp;Pending dev team checking.</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ <b><font color="#f28e0f">[2026-07-27]</font></b> Update Database Change Log</div><div><div><font color="#660ff2">UPDATE databasechangelog SET md5sum = ''7:1b787ba91d7829ab7669310831dbe31a'' WHERE md5sum = ''7:9cd648d668afedc1f7fcb8e47422b3de'';</font></div></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(242, 142, 15); font-weight: bolder;">[2026-07-27]&nbsp;</span>Deploy FE ear&nbsp;<font color="#f28e0f">ru.bpc.sv_c1c7682a.ear</font> file again and SVFE DB patch <b>#49</b></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(242, 142, 15); font-weight: bolder;">[2026-07-28]&nbsp;</span>Deploy Script&nbsp;<font color="#f28e0f">svfe_db_patch_391.sql</font>&nbsp;<b>#56</b>&nbsp;=&gt; Fixed Card Limit Issue&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;+&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(242, 142, 15); font-weight: bolder;">[2026-07-28]&nbsp;</span>Deploy FE ear file<font color="#f28e0f"> ru.bpc.sv_1ef22ae6.ea</font>r&nbsp;<b>#62</b>&nbsp;=&gt; Fixed view key data issue&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>==&gt; Close Ticket&nbsp;</div><div><br></div>', DATE '2026-07-06', 'Completed', '1106997e-7ec9-44c4-bfed-15d6dab183bb'),
('e5e5ddf4-9169-4525-a5c8-68e3dc2f30ad', NULL, 'list', 'Kick-Off Meeting with MasterCard Regarding ABU Project', 'Medium', '<div>As the monthly project fee will be count from start date project to end of month. So, we decide to start project from next month.</div>Project will start from <b><font color="#f28e0f">01-Aug-2026</font> - <font color="#f28e0f">31-Aug-2026</font></b>', DATE '2026-07-21', 'To Do', 'e31ee399-bcff-4c4e-91bb-ed133f54e0ee'),
('d7e63d92-04e3-4be0-846d-4f064388df7a', DATE '2026-07-28', 'list', 'Disable ATM Remote Desktop Port', 'Medium', '+ Completed 80%<div>+ Pending 3 ATMs at Bavet Branch</div>', DATE '2026-07-08', 'In Progress', '1c91fdce-fdc5-4a6c-ad40-46ee5df65ffd'),
('c58b8bb2-a633-4258-915e-928cfe9e884c', DATE '2026-07-27', 'list', 'Visa Clearing Exchange (VCX) Remediation-CUBC[SR#2004270772]', 'Medium', '1.&nbsp; Inform Team <font color="#e0271f"><b>DO NOT</b></font> process any clearing VISA.&nbsp;<div>2. Ask Server Team to check point on VCX server for backup</div><div>3. Review the VISA Fixed Script and Deploy</div><div>4. <b><font color="#e0271f">DO NOT</font></b> Download VISA Full BIN replacement CXArdef until VISA verify log and confirm the result of deployment.</div>', DATE '2026-07-27', 'To Do', 'b4b761d5-96f7-4d7a-880d-62a018c21e6b'),
