('c684ee7d-aed8-4479-bc45-0db380614060', NULL, 'list', 'Pre-Prod Server SmartVista Hardware', 'Medium', '<div><b>+ Server IP&nbsp;</b></div>- SVFE APP :&nbsp;10.24.207.62&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;User: svfe,&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pass:&nbsp;Svfe@2026!#9<div>- SVBO APP:&nbsp;10.24.207.63&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;User: weblogic,&nbsp; Pass: Cubc@2026!@#</div><div>- SVCG APP:&nbsp;10.24.207.64&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;User: weblogic,&nbsp; Pass:&nbsp;Cubc@2026!@#</div><div><br></div><div>- SVFE DB&nbsp; :&nbsp;10.24.207.65&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; User: oracle,&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Pass:&nbsp;Cucb2026#svDB</div><div>- SVBO DB :&nbsp;10.24.207.66&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; User: oracle,&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Pass:&nbsp;Cucb2026#svDB</div><div>- SVCG DB :&nbsp;10.24.207.67&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; User: oracle,&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Pass:&nbsp;Cucb2026#svDB</div><div><br></div><div><b>+ KH user credential</b></div><div>KH1162&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Cubc@2026!@#</div><div><br></div><div>1. <font color="#f28e0f">[2026-08-06]</font> Get Server Info</div><div>2.<font color="#f28e0f">[2026-08-07]</font> Run Prerequisite check and ask server team to increase CPU and RAM,&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; - Re-run check and provide check log to BPC.</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; - Disable SELINUX , vi /etc/selinux/config,&nbsp;SELINUX=disabled, reboot, sestatus</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; - Install required library:&nbsp;gcc gcc-c++ glibc-devel ksh libnsl libstdc++-devel make motif motif-devel openssl-devel pcre-devel perl sysstat telnet tmux xterm zlib-devel</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; - Submit check result to BPC&nbsp;</div>', DATE '2026-08-06', 'In Progress', '1106997e-7ec9-44c4-bfed-15d6dab183bb');
